The task-specific libssh2 gates remain green, including the new compatibility test. The repository-wide gate is red, exit 1: two unrelated HEV UDP tests failed with five assertions, matching the order-sensitive aggregate flake already disclosed by the accepted physical-Mac evidence. I’m keeping that gate explicitly red, checking the failures in isolation, and looking for an existing focused rework owner rather than laundering the result as a pass.
